 29	 * Answers whether this account can probe a neighbour now, and which one.
 30	 *
 31	 * Scouting is the ordinary first contact an experienced player makes with the
 32	 * galaxies around them, and it is what turns "no target intel" into the reports
 33	 * raids later depend on. The target is a foreign planet the account does not own
 34	 * and whose owner is neither in vacation mode nor the protected administrator —
 35	 * the same gates the host's own espionage mission applies — and the probe the
 36	 * mission consumes is the ship the host requires. The candidate list is the
